#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:5
#: 3737120825844dd9b1df829cb5f7c73f
msgid "Tuning Process Instructions"
msgstr "调参过程说明"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:8
#: 5433eda33c9347bda6359b78f1cfae10
msgid "Setting the aircraft up to be ready for tuning"
msgstr "将飞行器设置为准备调参状态"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:10
#: 8892cea1d2f143f38747224831f63cec
msgid ""
"The following parameters should be set correctly based on the specifications"
" of your aircraft."
msgstr "以下参数应根据您飞行器的规格正确设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:13
#: 4728c28db1dd46f2a1876e7327d913a6
msgid "Step 1: Battery and expo settings"
msgstr "第 1 步：电池和 expo 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:15
#: b0f9e78b60674bc3b59979d92a0b6712
msgid ""
"It is very important to ensure that the thrust curve of your VTOL motors is "
"as linear as possible. A linear thrust curve means that changes in the "
"actual thrust produced by a motor is directly proportional to the thrust "
"being demanded by ArduPilot. If your thrust curve is badly non-linear then "
"you will never produce a good tune, and in some cases may end up with such a"
" bad tune that your vehicle can become completely unstable and crash."
msgstr ""
"确保 VTOL 电机的推力曲线尽可能线性至关重要。线性推力曲线意味着电机实际产生的推力变化与 ArduPilot "
"要求的推力成正比。如果推力曲线严重非线性，您将永远无法产生良好的调参结果，在某些情况下甚至可能产生如此糟糕的调参，以至于飞行器变得完全不稳定并坠机。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:23
#: c2b29425d6c54f2f8db0e0e4ebcbbcc9
msgid "There are 3 common causes of a non-linear thrust curve."
msgstr "推力曲线非线性有 3 种常见原因。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:25
#: b7991ce7e63744e698fc294a8c91dbcf
msgid ""
"voltage sag as throttle is increased or the forward motor is engaged. This "
"is very common in QuadPlanes"
msgstr "油门增加或前进电机接合时的电压下垂。这在四旋翼飞机中非常常见"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:26
#: 686ada30b07d4065a93e5869c2c56d72
msgid ""
"incorrect end-point setup in the PWM range you use to your ESCs (see "
"\"Motors setup\" below)"
msgstr "ESC 使用的 PWM 范围端点设置不正确（参见下方「电机设置」）"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:27
#: 347babc67e9d48799c0ff61bef346047
msgid ""
"non-linearity in the thrust produced by your propeller, ESC and motor "
"combination"
msgstr "螺旋桨、ESC和电机组合产生的推力固有非线性"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:29
#: 41cf4042fd3e4a4c813645f7f6d53dd9
msgid "Start with setting up the voltage range to cope with voltage sag."
msgstr "首先设置电压范围以应对电压下垂。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:31
#: 048e55a6a86f492ebbf346f6360e6515
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_M_BAT_IDX <Q_M_BAT_IDX>`: index of the battery to use for voltage "
"measurements on VTOL power system. Zero is the first battery, one for 2nd "
"battery etc"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_M_BAT_IDX <Q_M_BAT_IDX>`：用于 VTOL "
"动力系统电压测量的电池索引。零表示第一块电池，一表示第二块电池，以此类推"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:32
#: 7b66a58f6e5c4385b79f158ca0300cdd
msgid ":ref:`Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MAX <Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MAX>`: 4.2v x No. Cells for LiPo"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MAX <Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MAX>`：锂聚合物电池为 4.2V × 节数"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:33
#: 9c96c2664cae4d3d90c41f759e370f0b
msgid ":ref:`Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MIN <Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MIN>`: 3.3v x No. Cells for LiPo"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MIN <Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MIN>`：锂聚合物电池为 3.3V × 节数"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:34
#: c95d0f1f982547f19c5c3d6997cb446c
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_M_OPTIONS<Q_M_OPTIONS>` = 0 (default). The default is to use sag "
"compensated voltage for the above and during tuning computations. It can be "
"set to 1 to use raw voltage instead of sag compensated voltage, which may "
"improve tuning results for light vehicles."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_M_OPTIONS<Q_M_OPTIONS>` = 0（默认）。默认使用电压下垂补偿电压进行上述和调参计算。可设置为 1 "
"以使用原始电压代替下垂补偿电压，这对轻型飞行器可能改善调参结果。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:36
#: 87133cb714c9405cb6907cb603d8ba76
msgid ""
"Note that :ref:`Q_M_BAT_IDX <Q_M_BAT_IDX>` needs to be for the correct "
"battery for your VTOL motors. If you have a separate battery for forward "
"motors and VTOL motors then make sure you use the right one."
msgstr ""
"请注意，:ref:`Q_M_BAT_IDX <Q_M_BAT_IDX>` 需要对应 VTOL 电机的正确电池。如果前进电机和 VTOL "
"电机使用单独的电池，请确保使用正确的那块。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:40
#: 1ba8d15c036c4faca19833afade913e6
msgid ""
"Next setup the thrust expo. If you are setting up a professional aircraft "
"then you should invest in a thrust stand so you can accurately measure the "
"true thrust for your motor/ESC/propeller combination as you vary the "
"throttle. Then you will adjust the expo value along with the endpoints "
"(given by motors setup below) so that the thrust between the endpoints is as"
" linear as possible. Do not trust manufacturer data for the thrust curve as "
"they are frequently inaccurate. See :ref:`motor-thrust-scaling` for details "
"on thrust scaling."
msgstr ""
"接下来设置推力 expo。如果您在设置专业飞行器，应投资购买推力台架，以便在改变油门时准确测量电机/ESC/螺旋桨组合的真实推力。然后您将调整 expo"
" 值以及端点（由下面的电机设置给出），使端点之间的推力尽可能线性。不要相信制造商的推力曲线数据，因为它们经常不准确。有关推力缩放的详情，请参阅 "
":ref:`motor-thrust-scaling`。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:48
#: fd8b625b4cf94abd9687baa5760503f6
msgid ""
"If you are setting up a hobby grade vehicle then you can use the graph below"
" to estimate the correct :ref:`Q_M_THST_EXPO <Q_M_THST_EXPO>` value for your"
" aircraft."
msgstr ""
"如果您在设置业余级飞行器，可以使用下面的图表估算适合您飞行器的 :ref:`Q_M_THST_EXPO <Q_M_THST_EXPO>` 值。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:51
#: d9d1245af8944ceebed3ee3ded446a0c
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_M_THST_EXPO <Q_M_THST_EXPO>`: 0.55 for 5 inch props, 0.65 for 10 "
"inch props, 0.75 for 20 inch props."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_M_THST_EXPO <Q_M_THST_EXPO>`：5 英寸螺旋桨为 0.55，10 英寸为 0.65，20 英寸为 0.75。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:57
#: 87a6a13c44fe437ca25df127d8092f6c
msgid "Step 2: Motors setup"
msgstr "第 2 步：电机设置"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:59
#: c0d062d11f934b6c8d1b03fb7df8efd8
msgid ""
"The motor parameters define the PWM output range sent to the ESCs. This is "
"critical to ensure that the entire range of throttle values used in flight "
"is within the linear range of your propulsion system."
msgstr "电机参数定义发送给 ESC 的 PWM 输出范围。这对于确保飞行中使用的全部油门值范围在推进系统的线性范围内至关重要。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:64
#: 7ce1e8c552a445499976fa2dd7cb4ea6
msgid ""
"For standard PWM based ESCs you should adjust :ref:`Q_M_PWM_MIN "
"<Q_M_PWM_MIN>` until it is approximately 20 microseconds below the minimum "
"value that causes the motors to just start spinning. If you are using "
"digital motor outputs (such as DShot) then this is not necessary and the "
"default of 1000 should be used."
msgstr ""
"对于标准 PWM ESC，您应调整 :ref:`Q_M_PWM_MIN <Q_M_PWM_MIN>`，使其大约低于导致电机刚开始旋转的最小值 20 "
"微秒。如果您使用数字电机输出（如 DShot），则无需此操作，应使用默认值 1000。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:70
#: 693073c1c2fe4d01b0495f35bfb61e8f
msgid ""
"You should then adjust :ref:`Q_M_PWM_MAX <Q_M_PWM_MAX>` to the value where "
"the ESCs stop producing more thrust. Note that this is commonly a bit below "
"the default maximum of 2000. To find the value you should test with "
"propellers removed, and use the motor test facility of your GCS to find the "
"lowest PWM value which produces the motors maximum RPM. You should be able "
"to tell at what PWM the motors stop producing more thrust by listening to "
"the sound made at different PWM values, or you can use a tachometer."
msgstr ""
"然后您应将 :ref:`Q_M_PWM_MAX <Q_M_PWM_MAX>` 调整到 ESC 停止产生更多推力的值。请注意，这通常略低于默认最大值 "
"2000。要找到该值，应在拆除螺旋桨后测试，并使用 GCS 的电机测试功能找到产生电机最大转速的最低 PWM 值。您可以通过听取不同 PWM "
"值下发出的声音来判断电机在何 PWM 时停止产生更多推力，或者使用转速计。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:79
#: 5fda6adfddb4456e9a049def8f410bf1
msgid ""
"The :ref:`Q_M_SPIN_MIN <Q_M_SPIN_MIN>` and :ref:`Q_M_SPIN_MAX<Q_M_SPIN_MAX>`"
" values are used to select a sub-range of the outputs to your motors which "
"is linear. For hobby users the defaults are usually good, but for "
"professional vehicles you should use the thrust stand data to determine the "
"right range to produce linear thrust after the expo is applied."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_M_SPIN_MIN <Q_M_SPIN_MIN>` 和 :ref:`Q_M_SPIN_MAX<Q_M_SPIN_MAX>` "
"值用于选择电机输出的线性子范围。对于业余用户，默认值通常足够，但对于专业飞行器，应使用推力台架数据来确定在应用 expo 后产生线性推力的正确范围。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:85
#: e7d57cf674ad4b3db234880242dd6597
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_M_PWM_MAX <Q_M_PWM_MAX>`: Check ESC manual for fixed range or 2000us"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_M_PWM_MAX <Q_M_PWM_MAX>`：查阅 ESC 手册中的固定范围或 2000us"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:86
#: e4f6bd3f670d4b9da5eb676660319ac6
