"<connect-escs-and-motors_testing_motor_spin_directions>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_M_SPIN_ARM <Q_M_SPIN_ARM>`：使用 :ref:`电机测试功能 <connect-escs-and-"
"motors_testing_motor_spin_directions>`"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:88
#: 618243b14d804497a12d90feca8df66f
