#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:125
#: b6c2929f7af94c8a820f2b08bd60ed11
msgid ""
"The initial tune of the aircraft should be done **in the aircraft's most "
"agile configuration**. This generally means that the aircraft will be at its"
" minimum take off weight with fully charged batteries."
msgstr "飞行器的初始调参应在 **飞行器最灵活的配置下** 进行。这通常意味着飞行器将以最小起飞重量、满电电池的状态进行。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:128
#: 10ad2929c5844c22999f088902f698ad
msgid "Step 4: Pilot's preparation for first flight"
msgstr "第 4 步：飞手首飞准备"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:130
#: ea72aa91a5c741e5b4c10cdc06da5685
msgid ""
"The first takeoff of an untuned VTOL vehicle is the most dangerous seconds "
"of the aircraft’s life. This is where the aircraft could be very unstable "
"causing a sudden increase in power when then results in the aircraft jumping"
" into the air, or it may be so poorly tuned that you have insufficient "
"control over the aircraft once it is airborne. The pilot should be extremely"
" diligent during the tuning flights to avoid a situation that could result "
"in injury or damage."
msgstr ""
"未调参 VTOL "
"飞行器的首次起飞是飞行器生命中最危险的几秒钟。此时飞行器可能非常不稳定，导致功率突然增加，使飞行器跳跃升空，或者调参极差导致飞行器升空后操控权不足。飞手在调参飞行期间应格外谨慎，避免可能导致人员受伤或设备损坏的情况。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:132
#: 457c79e18c924a30a850c821f9585b49
msgid ""
"There are several things that the pilot can do to minimize the risk during "
"the early tuning process:"
msgstr "飞手可以采取以下几种措施来最大程度降低早期调参过程中的风险："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:134
#: 750b970d99b345ebb9e3873b154e7445
msgid ""
"The pilot should conduct a motor number and orientation check (see "
":ref:`Checking the motor numbering with the Mission Planner Motor test "
"<connect-escs-and-motors_testing_motor_spin_directions>`). Care should be "
"taken to ensure that the correct frame type is selected. Incorrect frame "
"type can result in a very fast yaw rotation or complete loss of control. "
"Take note of the output percentage required to spin the propellers and "
"ensure that:"
msgstr ""
"飞手应进行电机编号和方向检查（参见 :ref:`Checking the motor numbering with the Mission "
"Planner Motor test <connect-escs-and-"
"motors_testing_motor_spin_directions>`）。应仔细确认选择了正确的机架类型。错误的机架类型可能导致飞机快速偏航旋转或完全失控。请注意旋转螺旋桨所需的输出百分比，并确保："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:136
#: e042118c6f0d44bc8e93b358dcf25949
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_M_SPIN_ARM <Q_M_SPIN_ARM>` is set high enough to spin the motors "
"cleanly."
msgstr ":ref:`Q_M_SPIN_ARM <Q_M_SPIN_ARM>` 设置足够高，以干净地旋转电机。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:137
#: fd84ae88f3194d5995f6a1be215e76c0
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_M_SPIN_MIN <Q_M_SPIN_MIN>` is set high enough to spin the motors "
"with a minimal level of thrust."
msgstr ":ref:`Q_M_SPIN_MIN <Q_M_SPIN_MIN>` 设置足够高，以最低推力水平旋转电机。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:139
#: 94d68840739f4f408c2d0acc051d3a17
msgid ""
"All flights after a significant tuning change should be done in QSTABILIZE. "
"QSTABIILIZE provides the pilot with significantly more control over the "
"aircraft in the event that the attitude controllers are unstable."
msgstr ""
"重大调参更改后的所有飞行都应在 QSTABILIZE 中进行。在姿态控制器不稳定的情况下，QSTABILIZE 为飞手提供对飞行器更多的控制权。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:140
#: 1022652e842d4836907f3b83c01e205f
msgid ""
"The pilot should not take off in QHOVER until the altitude controller has "
"been tested in flight. This should be done by taking off in QSTABILIZE and "
"switching to QHOVER. Although QHOVER is rarely a problem unless the aircraft"
" has a very low hover throttle."
msgstr ""
"飞手在飞行中测试高度控制器之前，不应在 QHOVER 中起飞。应通过在 QSTABILIZE 中起飞然后切换到 QHOVER 来测试。尽管 QHOVER"
" 很少出现问题，除非飞行器的悬停油门非常低。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:141
#: 351325ab260645e58c7f0807d45ff809
msgid ""
"For the initial flights the pilot should ensure that these parameters are "
"set:"
msgstr "初次飞行时，飞手应确保这些参数已设置："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:143
#: 56d9ae41fb7b43a58c599364eeb77525
msgid ":ref:`Q_A_THR_MIX_MAN <Q_A_THR_MIX_MAN>` to 0.1"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_A_THR_MIX_MAN <Q_A_THR_MIX_MAN>` 设为 0.1"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:144
#: 026a4cdcd1c74d5c8e89cd5355bd6c94
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_M_THST_HOVER <Q_M_THST_HOVER>` to 0.25 (or lower than the expected "
"hover throttle)"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_M_THST_HOVER <Q_M_THST_HOVER>` 设为 0.25（或低于预期悬停油门）"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:146
#: 7ad3226b81a84ec19de3ef433570fdcc
msgid ""
"Use a radio and calibrate the radio correctly (see :ref:`common-radio-"
"control-calibration`)."
msgstr "使用遥控器并正确校准遥控器（参见 :ref:`common-radio-control-calibration`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:147
#: a006f4f8fa0a4308a7fd93935c23af3e
msgid ""
"Configure an ARM/DISARM switch and test it (see :ref:`Auxiliary Functions "
"<common-auxiliary-functions>`)."
msgstr "配置解锁/上锁开关并测试（参见 :ref:`辅助功能 <common-auxiliary-functions>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:148
#: 8aa7a3cc73154001aaad034a82703964
msgid ""
"Do tuning flights in low-wind condition and normal weather (no rain and "
"between 15°C/59°F and 25°C/77°F)."
msgstr "在低风条件和正常天气下进行调参飞行（无雨，温度在 15°C/59°F 至 25°C/77°F 之间）。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:149
#: a20a3d3f7b574996b5b354dbc4a78893
msgid ""
"Practice QSTABILIZE flight in simulator or on a low-end drone first. You "
"should be confident to be able to takeoff and land with your untuned "
"aircraft."
msgstr "首先在模拟器或低端无人机上练习 QSTABILIZE 飞行。您应该有信心能够用未调参的飞行器起飞和降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:152
#: 347b64b4adfd4867afe0e12a9a9d2707
msgid "Tuning Process"
msgstr "调参过程"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:155
#: 9ddc72d49b4745d9b7c2fac5a5aa2215
msgid "Step 5: First Flight"
msgstr "第 5 步：首飞"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:157
#: 35d5965cfcbd40efaf52fbb824fb9710
msgid ""
"The first take off is the most dangerous time for any QuadPlane. Care must "
"be taken to ensure the aircraft is not destroyed in the first seconds of "
"flight and nobody is injured."
msgstr "首次起飞是任何四旋翼飞机最危险的时刻。必须谨慎确保飞行器不会在飞行的最初几秒内被损毁，且无人受伤。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:159
#: 43970c4b7d6149e7bb3474187b87d766
msgid "**Ensure that all spectators are at a safe distance**."
msgstr "**确保所有旁观者保持安全距离**。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:160
#: 8e2d3089cd8543c6887fc270c8a3f4b4
msgid "**Ensure the pilot is at a safe distance and position**."
msgstr "**确保飞手保持安全距离和位置**。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:161
#: e601478e8bc34083b02cb209052703e7
msgid ""
"The pilot should refresh themselves on the method used to disarm the "
"aircraft (using :ref:`Auxiliary Functions <common-auxiliary-functions>` for "
"Motor Interlock or Arm/Disarm may be beneficial)."
msgstr ""
"飞手应复习用于上锁飞机的方法（使用 :ref:`Auxiliary Functions <common-auxiliary-functions>` "
"中的电机互锁或解锁/上锁功能可能有所帮助）。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:163
#: 815180dfe28e472bb3c3b15ecc3f601f
msgid ""
"This flight will allow to setup your aircraft in a \"flyable for tuning\" "
"state."
msgstr "此飞行将使您能够将飞行器设置为「可飞行以进行调参」状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:165
#: e45ee623cdb34939971677c5793ed21d
msgid "Ensure the aircraft is in QSTABILIZE mode"
msgstr "确保飞行器处于 QSTABILIZE 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:166
#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:168
#: 1f50bc0ea8594186820f1a7ace4766a7 7f2dc58ced044731b7ef9a94a4482015
msgid "Arm the aircraft"
msgstr "解锁飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:167
#: 256dc9e8f62b4232ba131fdca4cb360f
msgid ""
"Immediately disarm the aircraft to ensure your disarm procedure is correct"
msgstr "立即上锁飞行器，以确认您的上锁程序正确"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:169
#: ee594c72327f42658e0057e49abb88d4
msgid ""
"Slowly increase the throttle looking for signs of oscillation. (long or "
"flexible landing gear may cause some landing gear oscillation that will only"
" go away after the aircraft leaves the ground)"
msgstr "缓慢增加油门，观察是否出现振荡。（较长或较软的起落架可能导致一些起落架振荡，这些振荡只有在飞机离地后才会消失。）"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:170
#: d805b9bf8346466995eda5aa07290402
msgid ""
"As soon as the aircraft lifts off the ground immediately put the aircraft "
"back down as gently as possible"
msgstr "飞行器一旦离地，立即尽可能轻柔地让飞行器降落"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:171
#: c2a44f4eba954d60bd08c1603848af53
msgid "Disarm the aircraft"
msgstr "上锁飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:172
#: e48dea6d19134938b377741cbdee7ab2
msgid ""
"Evaluate what you observed to decide if you need to make adjustments to the "
"tuning parameters or if it is safe to take off again"
msgstr "评估观察到的情况，决定是否需要调整调参参数，或者是否可以安全地再次起飞"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:173
#: 53e75101a82a4c4689d7b71f43c49e5e
msgid "Arm and increase the throttle to initiate a takeoff"
msgstr "解锁并增加油门以启动起飞"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:174
#: 0dab621b596648aeabf24c084fed660e
msgid ""
"Hover at approximately 1m altitude and apply small (5 degrees) control "
"inputs into roll and pitch"
msgstr "在约 1m 高度悬停，并施加小幅（5 度）的横滚和俯仰控制输入"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:175
#: faa2384542f34904a230116d0e15306d
msgid "Immediately land if any oscillation is observed"
msgstr "一旦观察到任何振荡，立即降落"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:177
#: 510f05fb8afd4360a9c8bdc250f6611a
msgid "Next section will explain how to remove the oscillations."
msgstr "下一节将说明如何消除振荡。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:180
#: 3560701ba2714d57a28ab382bdf59b7c
msgid "Step 6: Initial aircraft tune"
msgstr "第 6 步：飞行器初始调参"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:182
#: 466c751ab287494e9699a3c960b104c4
msgid ""
"The first priority when tuning a QuadPlane is to establish a stable tune, "
"free of oscillations, that can be used to do further tests."
msgstr "调参四旋翼飞机的首要任务是建立一个稳定的、无振荡的调参结果，以便进行进一步测试。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:184
#: bcd7b8259fd54b7281e4931c6bacd84a
msgid "Arm the aircraft in QSTABILIZE"
msgstr "在 QSTABILIZE 中解锁飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:185
#: e1c4f20282a3441795ae24f1cd6b897d
msgid "Increase the throttle slowly until the aircraft leaves the ground"
msgstr "缓慢增加油门直到飞行器离地"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:186
#: 60b66193aa4b4774bda6238303179c81
msgid ""
"If the aircraft starts to oscillate immediately abort the takeoff and/or "
"land the aircraft, and:"
msgstr "如果飞行器开始振荡，立即中止起飞和/或降落飞行器，并："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:187
#: 002b043204544b12ba35bc94291e43e9
msgid "Reduce all the following parameters by 50%"
msgstr "将以下所有参数减少 50%"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:189
#: eb79a05016b34caea95b47a46f4d4845
msgid ":ref:`Q_A_RAT_PIT_P <Q_A_RAT_PIT_P>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_A_RAT_PIT_P <Q_A_RAT_PIT_P>`"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:190
#: 6088bf7b1e2e43d0879e79b105d637d6
msgid ":ref:`Q_A_RAT_PIT_I <Q_A_RAT_PIT_I>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_A_RAT_PIT_I <Q_A_RAT_PIT_I>`"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:191
#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:319
#: 617bc491bc134ea19719e88ca4ee37df 6e6aed2fd829424f988478fdaae97ab3
msgid ":ref:`Q_A_RAT_PIT_D <Q_A_RAT_PIT_D>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_A_RAT_PIT_D <Q_A_RAT_PIT_D>`"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:192
#: c3898933939645b5bf2f2d8d9748be61
msgid ":ref:`Q_A_RAT_RLL_P <Q_A_RAT_RLL_P>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_A_RAT_RLL_P <Q_A_RAT_RLL_P>`"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:193
#: 3a126c39d1c3440382ab7a7dfc613250
msgid ":ref:`Q_A_RAT_RLL_I <Q_A_RAT_RLL_I>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_A_RAT_RLL_I <Q_A_RAT_RLL_I>`"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:194
#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:317
#: 631659a801964ba68b890eac8e38a8d1 98480fab608a4bcca773eacebdf55925
msgid ":ref:`Q_A_RAT_RLL_D <Q_A_RAT_RLL_D>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_A_RAT_RLL_D <Q_A_RAT_RLL_D>`"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:196
#: 3d4cba163a4f4e8f90b9853a04b2a80f
msgid ""
"This process is repeated until the aircraft can hover without oscillations "
"being detectable visually or audibly."
msgstr "重复此过程，直到飞机能够悬停而目视或听觉均无法察觉到振荡为止。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:198
#: b4fa4efa56394e66b978d90751366d2a
msgid ""
"If the aircraft has very long or flexible landing gear then you may need to "
"leave the ground before ground resonance stops."
msgstr "如果飞行器的起落架非常长或非常柔软，您可能需要在地面共振停止前先离地。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:200
#: f2d42fed550043c4b2d2e0057d0cbec0
msgid ""
"Be aware that in this state the aircraft may be very slow to respond to "
"large control inputs and disturbances. The pilot should be extremely careful"
" to put minimal stick inputs into the aircraft to avoid the possibility of a"
" crash."
msgstr "请注意，在这种状态下，飞行器对大的控制输入和扰动的响应可能非常迟缓。飞手应极其谨慎地向飞行器施加最小的摇杆输入，以避免坠机的可能。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:203
#: 8fc22df4cfb349a78504bf93f7337d74
msgid "Step 7: Test QHOVER"
msgstr "第 7 步：测试 QHOVER"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:205
#: 15b0f60e21024392b2c187943b53d2c4
msgid ""
"This test will allow to test the altitude controller and ensure the "
"stability of your aircraft."
msgstr "此测试将允许测试高度控制器并确保飞行器的稳定性。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:207
#: c3d25e8c17bc4284a547e820ed4170a9
msgid ""
"Check :ref:`Q_M_HOVER_LEARN <Q_M_HOVER_LEARN>` is set to 2. This will allow "
"the controller to learn by itself the correct hover value when flying."
msgstr ""
"检查 :ref:`Q_M_HOVER_LEARN <Q_M_HOVER_LEARN>` 是否设置为 2。这将允许控制器在飞行时自行学习正确的悬停值。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:209
#: 27455a5adf18436ab0e487c6f0c95608
msgid ""
"the Hover throttle value is only \"learned\" when the attitude is not being "
"commanded by the pilot, or autopilot (ie QLOITER,etc.), to exceed 5 degrees "
"from neutral for two seconds."
msgstr "悬停油门值仅在飞手或飞控（如 QLOITER 等）未命令姿态超过中立点 5 度持续两秒时才会「学习」。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:211
#: 54a4944dd1184093a9318f19ac364676
msgid ""
"Take off in QSTABILIZE and increase altitude to 5m. Switch to QHOVER and be "
"ready to switch back to QSTABILIZE. If the aircraft is hovering at a very "
"low hover throttle value you may hear a reasonably fast oscillation in the "
"motors. Ensure the aircraft has spent at least 30 seconds in hover to let "
"the hover throttle parameter converge to the correct value. Land and disarm "
"the aircraft."
msgstr ""
"在 QSTABILIZE 中起飞，爬升至 5m 高度。切换到 QHOVER，并准备好切换回 "
"QSTABILIZE。如果飞行器以非常低的悬停油门悬停，您可能会听到电机发出相当快速的振荡声。确保飞行器在悬停状态下至少停留 30 "
"秒，让悬停油门参数收敛到正确值。降落并上锁飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:213
#: 1528e89276d041818a0a0711682d20fd
msgid ""
"Set these parameters on ground and preferably disarm  (A confident pilot "
"could set them in flight with GCS):"
msgstr "在地面设置这些参数，最好在上锁状态下设置（有经验的飞手可以用 GCS 在飞行中设置）："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:215
#: 4df72cc92e0544e68f6392be4838a34f
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_P_D_ACC_I<Q_P_D_ACC_I>` to 0.2 x :ref:`Q_M_THST_HOVER "
"<Q_M_THST_HOVER>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_P_D_ACC_I<Q_P_D_ACC_I>` 设为 0.2 x :ref:`Q_M_THST_HOVER "
"<Q_M_THST_HOVER>`"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:216
#: 58983a2b79a1457b83fa03b24b471f20
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_P_D_ACC_P<Q_P_D_ACC_P>` to 0.1 x :ref:`Q_M_THST_HOVER "
"<Q_M_THST_HOVER>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_P_D_ACC_P<Q_P_D_ACC_P>` 设为 0.1 x :ref:`Q_M_THST_HOVER "
"<Q_M_THST_HOVER>`"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:218
#: 31e8c915871f46098125190bffbd558c
msgid ""
"In Plane 4.6 and earlier these parameters were named ``Q_P_ACCZ_I`` and "
"``Q_P_ACCZ_P`` and were scaled 10x larger:"
msgstr ""
"在 Plane 4.6 及更早版本中，这些参数名为 ``Q_P_ACCZ_I`` 和 ``Q_P_ACCZ_P``，且数值放大了 10 倍："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:220
#: 7d59ba768873421a81336128bcf9dcae
msgid "``Q_P_ACCZ_I`` to 2 x :ref:`Q_M_THST_HOVER <Q_M_THST_HOVER>`"
msgstr "``Q_P_ACCZ_I`` 设为 2 x :ref:`Q_M_THST_HOVER <Q_M_THST_HOVER>`"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:221
#: 22896b43158d430cbf3e9dcc052c8cf9
msgid "``Q_P_ACCZ_P`` to :ref:`Q_M_THST_HOVER <Q_M_THST_HOVER>`"
msgstr "``Q_P_ACCZ_P`` 设为 :ref:`Q_M_THST_HOVER <Q_M_THST_HOVER>`"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:223
#: a108d06bdf40446fbb1c6fd8f3ee785b
msgid ""
"If the QuadPlane in QHOVER starts to move up and down, the vertical position"
" and velocity controllers may need to be reduced by 50%. These values are: "
":ref:`Q_P_D_POS_P<Q_P_D_POS_P>` and :ref:`Q_P_D_VEL_P<Q_P_D_VEL_P>`."
msgstr ""
"如果 QuadPlane 在 QHOVER 中开始上下浮动，垂直位置和速度控制器的增益可能需要减小 "
"50%。这些参数为：:ref:`Q_P_D_POS_P<Q_P_D_POS_P>` 和 :ref:`Q_P_D_VEL_P<Q_P_D_VEL_P>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:225
#: 16710138e6a4428cb1a8c82d3fe3a0c8
msgid ""
"If the :ref:`Q_M_THST_HOVER<Q_M_THST_HOVER>` learned should be ~0.3-0.6. "
"Higher values indicate that insufficient thrust is available, either due to "
"motor system design, obstructed prop air flow by the fuselage or wings, or "
"excessive yaw bias (see next section)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_M_THST_HOVER<Q_M_THST_HOVER>` 学习值应约为 "
"0.3-0.6。较高的值表明可用推力不足，原因可能是电机系统设计问题、机身或机翼阻碍螺旋桨气流，或过大的偏航偏置（见下一节）"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:228
#: 075014692cae489bbafbcdced45d4c6d
msgid "Step 8: Yaw Bias"
msgstr "第 8 步：偏航偏置"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:230
#: f5330e03287e46cb957cc2b2834f67c7
msgid ""
"A common problem in QuadPlanes is excessive amount of VTOL power being used "
"to maintain yaw hold instead of providing lift. This can be caused by:"
msgstr "四旋翼飞机中的一个常见问题是，过多的 VTOL 功率被用于维持偏航保持而非提供升力。这可能由以下原因引起："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:233
#: ca3a760dc70d469d88bf77f5b418ffb7
msgid "small misalignment of the VTOL motors"
msgstr "VTOL 电机的微小对齐偏差"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:234
#: 2792124bf8cb4ae2ba37fa0af38c014a
msgid "frame twist (often caused by wing twist) as thrust is applied"
msgstr "施加推力时的机架扭转（通常由机翼扭转引起）"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:235
#: 8546d4e3aab4458ea0b334c95a5c1ca7
msgid ""
"obstructed prop air flow by wings in :ref:`TVBS type tailsitters<tvbs>` "
"making vectored yaw by motor tilt less effective. This can also cause enough"
" reduction in normal thrust to make hovering and VTOL climb difficult."
msgstr ""
"在 :ref:`TVBS 型尾坐式<tvbs>` 中机翼阻碍螺旋桨气流，使通过电机倾转的矢量偏航效果降低。这也可能导致正常推力足够减少，使悬停和 "
"VTOL 爬升困难。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:237
#: 713390831acd4169b4f57f2ae88e9cdc
msgid ""
"If too much power is needed to maintain yaw then the aircraft could lose yaw"
" control during transitions, or could lose roll and pitch stability. The "
"most common symptom is a high hover throttle point, or even the inability to"
" rise into a hover at high throttle stick position. For larger QuadPlanes it"
" is common to need to deliberately tilt the motors by a couple of degrees to"
" increase yaw authority."
msgstr ""
"如果需要太多功率来维持偏航，飞行器在过渡期间可能会失去偏航控制，或者失去横滚和俯仰稳定性。最常见的症状是悬停油门点较高，甚至在高油门杆位置时无法升入悬停。对于较大的四旋翼飞机，通常需要有意将电机倾斜几度以增加偏航权限。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:242
#: 7e1cb7d4876b449b8c8c015e3810d84b
msgid ""
"for an X frame type (:ref:`Q_FRAME_TYPE<Q_FRAME_TYPE>` = 1), the motors "
"should be tilted outwards. For an H frame (:ref:`Q_FRAME_TYPE<Q_FRAME_TYPE>`"
" = 3) they should be tilted inwards."
msgstr ""
"对于 X 型机架（:ref:`Q_FRAME_TYPE<Q_FRAME_TYPE>` = 1），电机应向外倾斜。对于 H "
"型机架（:ref:`Q_FRAME_TYPE<Q_FRAME_TYPE>` = 3），电机应向内倾斜。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:246
#: d5a0476750e94e54be6ddf986f65ec8d
msgid ""
"You should check the amount of thrust being used to maintain yaw by looking "
"at the RATE YOut value in your hover logs. If it is over 10% (a value of "
"0.1) when hovering in no wind with no pilot input,then you have a problem "
"with yaw asymmetry that should be fixed. Just hovering in place may look "
"fine and you may not see the problem until you examine the log."
msgstr ""
"您应通过查看悬停日志中的 RATE YOut 值来检查用于维持偏航保持的推力量。如果在无风、无飞手输入的悬停中超过 10%（值为 "
"0.1），则您存在偏航不对称问题，应予以修正。仅在原地悬停可能看起来正常，您可能在检查日志之前不会发现问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:252
#: c0af2f5683484ca39158a79761fbc0d0
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"The log below shows RATE.YOut (orange) increasing dramatically while motor 1"
" (RCOUT.C5) is idling and motor 2 (RCOUT.C6) is barely working, but at the "
"same time motor 3 (RCOUT.C7) and motor 4 (RCOUT.C8) are are running > 50% "
"output. This limits how much higher the firmware could raise the overall "
"thrust due to these motors maxing out."
msgstr ""
"下面的日志显示 RATE.YOut（橙色）急剧增加，同时电机 1（RCOUT.C5）处于怠速状态，电机 2（RCOUT.C6）几乎不工作，但同时电机 "
"3（RCOUT.C7）和电机 4（RCOUT.C8）的输出超过 50%。这限制了固件能够提高总推力的程度，因为这些电机已达到最大值。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:259
#: 91ae1d5e7c914b78904ef8de6ef4abfb
msgid ""
"Fixing yaw asymmetry can involve mechanical improvements such as stiffening "
"the airframe to resist twisting, making sure prop flow is unobstructed by "
"the wings on TVBS frames,or correcting/adjusting motor tilt angles"
msgstr "修正偏航不对称可能涉及机械改进，例如加固机架以抵抗扭转，确保 TVBS 机架上机翼不阻碍螺旋桨气流，或者纠正/调整电机倾斜角度"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:262
#: afacdc2a108149fb9d67801a5b6699d2
msgid ""
"Some QuadPlanes will benefit from being setup as H frames instead of X "
"frames. Which works best depends on the way the motor mounts twist when "
"under thrust. If you have a persistent problem with yaw control then "
"consider trying to change the frame type between X and H, however a "
"quadplane with motors mounted on booms secured to the wings would normally "
"be setup as an X frame."
msgstr ""
"一些四旋翼飞机可能受益于设置为 H 型机架而非 X 型机架。哪种效果更好取决于电机支架在推力下的扭转方式。如果您在偏航控制方面存在持续问题，请考虑在 X"
" 型和 H 型之间切换机架类型，但安装在机翼支臂上的四旋翼飞机通常应设置为 X 型机架。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:270
#: 331698f8e39e490eb8204d851ec02cd0
msgid "Step 9: Notch Filtering"
msgstr "第 9 步：陷波滤波"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:272
#: b239acf4830e42ca91b2ffb6bdc9fc77
msgid ""
"After your have QHOVER flying without oscillations the next step is to get "
"get a good notch filter setup to reduce noise to the VTOL PID controllers. A"
" good set of notch filtering parameters is critical to a good tune."
msgstr ""
"在 QHOVER 飞行无振荡之后，下一步是设置良好的陷波滤波器，以减少 VTOL PID "
"控制器的噪声。一套良好的陷波滤波器参数对于良好的调参结果至关重要。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:277
#: ea8ee22617e14aa2b176455d988335e7
msgid ""
"To get a notch filter setup you need to hover your QuadPlane for 2 minutes "
"with no pilot input and with :ref:`INS_LOG_BAT_MASK <INS_LOG_BAT_MASK>` set "
"to 1. This will enable FFT logging which will guide the correct setup of the"
" notch filters. You should then carefully read the :ref:`common-imu-notch-"
"filtering` documentation and setup a harmonic notch to remove the noise from"
" your gyros."
msgstr ""
"要设置陷波滤波器，您需要在无飞手输入且 :ref:`INS_LOG_BAT_MASK <INS_LOG_BAT_MASK>` 设置为 1 "
"的情况下悬停四旋翼飞机 2 分钟。这将启用 FFT 日志记录，指导正确设置陷波滤波器。然后您应仔细阅读 :ref:`common-imu-notch-"
"filtering` 文档，并设置谐波陷波以消除陀螺仪噪声。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:284
#: 8751bd465b2a4aa18f75988a32c871c2
msgid ""
"When setting up your filtering you should consider the cause of any "
"oscillation you find. On most aircraft the vibrations you find will be "
"directly caused by a multiple of the RPM, but on some aircraft a frame "
"resonance or resonance in the autopilot mount may be the cause. "
"Understanding the cause of any resonances is critical to reducing noise "
"enough to get a good tune."
msgstr ""
"设置滤波器时，应考虑发现的任何振荡的原因。在大多数飞行器上，发现的震动直接由转速的倍数引起，但在某些飞行器上，机架共振或飞控安装座的共振可能是原因。了解任何共振的原因对于充分降低噪声以获得良好调参结果至关重要。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:292
#: 462086d44ff7410789663535ed3c5053
msgid "Step 10: Manual tuning of Roll and Pitch"
msgstr "第 10 步：手动调整横滚和俯仰"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:294
#: bcd7039ef3174951ab763de5f7c45122
msgid ""
"While you may be tempted to jump straight to autotuning, this is not "
"recommended. Most QuadPlanes need some manual tuning of roll and pitch "
"before they can handle an autotune. If you jump straight to an autotune then"
" your aircraft may become unstable enough to crash. A good manual tune will "
"also reduce the amount of time an autotune will take, which can be critical "
"given the small VTOL hover times of many QuadPlanes."
msgstr ""
"虽然您可能想直接跳到自动调参，但不建议这样做。大多数四旋翼飞机在进行自动调参之前需要一些手动横滚和俯仰调参。如果直接跳到自动调参，您的飞行器可能会变得不稳定到足以坠机。良好的手动调参还将减少自动调参所需的时间，这在许多四旋翼飞机"
" VTOL 悬停时间较短的情况下尤为关键。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:302
#: d8d7c734933c48a3aa8dc930554a244b
msgid ""
"Before starting the manual tune you should go back and check you have fully "
"completed the steps above, and ensure you have a good notch filter setup to "
"remove noise from the gyros."
msgstr "开始手动调参之前，您应返回检查是否已完全完成上述步骤，并确保有良好的陷波滤波器设置来消除陀螺仪噪声。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:306
#: ca3a4b85d8d849c397f076fcbe642691
msgid ""
"Hover the aircraft in QSTABILIZE or QHOVER modes, in low wind, with good sky"
" view and good GPS lock. You should adjust the rate gains as described "
"below, using small \"twitches\" on the sticks after each change to try to "
"trigger oscillation."
msgstr ""
"在低风、良好天空视野和良好 GPS 锁定的情况下，在 QSTABILIZE 或 QHOVER "
"模式中悬停飞行器。您应按照下文描述调整速率增益，在每次更改后使用小的「轻触」摇杆来尝试触发振荡。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:311
#: 8cbecc0aca134631b147ac5d6fe47467
msgid ""
"If oscillations start do not make large or sudden stick inputs. Reduce the "
"throttle smoothly to land the aircraft while using very slow and small roll "
"and pitch inputs to control the aircraft position."
msgstr "如果振荡开始，不要进行大的或突然的摇杆输入。平稳减少油门降落飞行器，同时使用非常缓慢和小幅的横滚和俯仰输入来控制飞行器位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:315
#: 4313dd68e6a64e4582248f0e6b8b5ee8
msgid "The parameters you will be adjusting are:"
msgstr "您将调整的参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:318
#: a4bf792a048b4dbb8cad9f21dcef825c
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_A_RAT_RLL_P <Q_A_RAT_RLL_P>` and :ref:`Q_A_RAT_RLL_I "
"<Q_A_RAT_RLL_I>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_A_RAT_RLL_P <Q_A_RAT_RLL_P>` 和 :ref:`Q_A_RAT_RLL_I <Q_A_RAT_RLL_I>`"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:320
#: 8a9d5ff56bf748d9abdc52c66ceb1d87
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_A_RAT_PIT_P <Q_A_RAT_PIT_P>` and :ref:`Q_A_RAT_PIT_I "
"<Q_A_RAT_PIT_I>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_A_RAT_PIT_P <Q_A_RAT_PIT_P>` 和 :ref:`Q_A_RAT_PIT_I <Q_A_RAT_PIT_I>`"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:322
#: e4a71e35642f4e82bbdea2b53426f9ae
msgid ""
"If the VTOL motors do not tilt, then the ``Q_A_RAT_PIT_FF`` and  "
"``Q_A_RAT_YAW_FF`` will be zero and corrections are dominated by P/I/D. But "
"if pitch or yaw control is primarily by tilting the motors, then the FF "
"terms dominate and P/D are primarily for disturbance correction. For tuning "
"a tilted motor controlled axis, see :ref:`pitch-yaw-tuning`."
msgstr ""
"如果 VTOL 电机不倾转，则 ``Q_A_RAT_PIT_FF`` 和 ``Q_A_RAT_YAW_FF`` 将为零，修正主要由 P/I/D "
"主导。但如果俯仰或偏航控制主要通过倾转电机实现，则 FF 项主导，P/D 主要用于扰动修正。有关倾转电机控制轴的调参，请参阅 :ref:`pitch-"
"yaw-tuning`。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:324
#: b2241425dd85459daac37c42af78d3bd
msgid "Start with the roll parameters, then move onto the pitch."
msgstr "从横滚参数开始，然后转到俯仰。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:326
#: 69d2dce5124c476b86e3bacd1e210765
#, no-python-format
msgid "Increase the D term in steps of 50% until oscillation is observed"
msgstr "以 50% 的步长增加 D 项，直到观察到振荡"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:327
#: c5ac28c1286e4ababa247036aa8cf6fc
#, no-python-format
msgid "Reduce the D term in steps of 10% until the oscillation disappears"
msgstr "以 10% 步进逐步降低 D 项直至振荡消失"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:328
#: 70b12cec55dc4397b7bd68ab7de411a8
msgid "Reduce the D term by a further 25%"
msgstr "再将 D 项减少 25%"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:329
#: 031a91087f10453fb32dc8916bad566e
#, no-python-format
msgid "Increase the P term in steps of 50% until oscillation is observed"
msgstr "以 50% 的步长增加 P 项，直到观察到振荡"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:330
#: 183899b500cb459ea3b3433454cd556a
#, no-python-format
msgid "Reduce the P term in steps of 10% until the oscillation disappears"
msgstr "以 10% 步进逐步降低 P 项直至振荡消失"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:331
#: f10bce7e514c43cca4ee5344cdaf3121
msgid "Reduce the P term by a further 25%"
msgstr "再将 P 项减少 25%"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:333
#: b06c32b5a7f4497e985c298ba821cf0d
msgid ""
"Each time the P term is changed in the above steps you should set the "
"corresponding I term equal to the P term. Those parameters can be changed on"
" ground and preferably disarmed. Alternatively, a confident pilot could set "
"them in flight with a GCS, or use the transmitter tuning option. See "
":ref:`common-transmitter-tuning`"
msgstr ""
"每次在上述步骤中更改 P 项时，您应将对应的 I 项设置为等于 P 项。这些参数可以在地面更改，最好在上锁状态下。或者，有经验的飞手可以用 GCS "
"在飞行中设置，或使用遥控器调参选项。参见 :ref:`common-transmitter-tuning`"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:339
#: a6ff9d17fa674c699200d458a4368914
msgid ""
"Note that it is common that once you have properly setup notch filtering "
"that you will be able to increase the D value a lot from the default value. "
"Increases of 10x over the default are not uncommon. Being able to use a "
"larger D gain is one of the main advantages of good notch filtering, and can"
" produce a much better tune."
msgstr ""
"请注意，正确设置陷波滤波器后，您通常能够将 D 值从默认值大幅增加。超过默认值 10 倍的增加并不罕见。能够使用更大的 D "
"增益是良好陷波滤波的主要优势之一，可以产生更好的调参结果。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:346
#: 19071ee573af45a2bf1860b74c02d69d
msgid ""
"After you have gone through the above steps you should carefully look at "
"your logs to ensure you don't have a hidden oscillation. The structure of "
"QuadPlanes sometimes means that oscillations may not be externally visible. "
"You should use the RATE, PIQR and PIQP messages to look for oscillations."
msgstr ""
"完成上述步骤后，您应仔细查看日志，确保没有隐藏的振荡。四旋翼飞机的结构有时意味着振荡在外部可能不可见。您应使用 RATE、PIQR 和 PIQP "
"消息来查找振荡。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:353
#: d7bcab7b31fe4655a92deb55c81aaf23
msgid "Step 11: Evaluating the aircraft tune"
msgstr "第 11 步：评估飞行器调参结果"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:355
#: 80d353c0315f450c8b567f3d8b6ef134
msgid ""
"You need to evaluate the aircraft's tune to see if the previous steps have "
"resulted in a tune which is good enough for a transition flight or for "
"autotuning."
msgstr "您需要评估飞行器的调参结果，以查看前面的步骤是否产生了足以进行过渡飞行或自动调参的调参结果。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:359
#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:370
#: 1c89339e3c34456e9a007bf9bc3d4136 f591f31688ab4a5fbb8187cd7e73209a
msgid "Take off in QHOVER or QSTABILIZE"
msgstr "在 QHOVER 或 QSTABILIZE 中起飞"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:360
#: e0e3e73fa6da495fb4f249a1a73cb864
msgid ""
"Apply small roll and pitch inputs. Start with 5 degree inputs and releasing "
"the stick to centre, pitch, left, right, roll forward back, then all 4 "
"points on the diagonal"
msgstr "施加小幅横滚和俯仰输入。从 5 度输入开始，释放摇杆到中心，依次测试俯仰、左、右、横滚前后，以及所有 4 个对角线方向"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:361
#: daf8f35b0f4f4000afc27edfe6521e80
msgid "Increase inputs gradually to full stick deflection"
msgstr "逐渐将输入增加到全摇杆偏转"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:362
#: 62045eaee1f342d58eca0b630906ff31
msgid ""
"Go to full stick deflection, quickly momentarily, and let the sticks spring "
"back to centre"
msgstr "短暂快速地全摇杆偏转，然后让摇杆弹回中位"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:364
#: a55656a32c674831aa4520234ac7c8b0
msgid ""
"If the aircraft begins to overshoot significantly or oscillate after the "
"stick input, halt the tests before the situation begins to endanger the "
"aircraft. The aircraft may require more manual tuning before autotuning can "
"be run."
msgstr "如果飞行器在摇杆输入后开始显著超调或振荡，在情况开始危及飞行器之前停止测试。飞行器可能需要在运行自动调参之前进行更多手动调参。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:368
#: 9af71888ece64100a9eb5c33d01e3d82
msgid ""
"To test the stabilization loops independent of the input shaping, set the "
"parameter: :ref:`Q_A_RATE_FF_ENAB <Q_A_RATE_FF_ENAB>` to 0."
msgstr ""
"要在独立于输入整形的情况下测试稳定控制回路，请将参数 :ref:`Q_A_RATE_FF_ENAB <Q_A_RATE_FF_ENAB>` 设置为 0。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:371
#: 02d558af01874acbad596e7b966cddba
msgid "Hold a roll or pitch input"
msgstr "保持横滚或俯仰输入"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:372
#: 837aa2d97527421694b7a245e8d3666e
msgid ""
"Release the stick and observe the overshoot as the aircraft levels itself"
msgstr "松开摇杆，观察飞机自我调平时的过冲"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:373
#: e26605c3278d4d48b000d1d7db2cc035
msgid "Gradually increase the stick deflection to 100%"
msgstr "逐渐将摇杆偏转增加到 100%"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:375
#: cc87dbd489de4bfb8a7de899f83f459c
msgid ""
"Halt the tests if the aircraft overshoots level significantly or if the "
"aircraft oscillates and go back to manual tuning."
msgstr "如果飞行器超调水平明显或飞行器振荡，停止测试并返回手动调参。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:378
#: cbd2f6ca4c3e44c5a06a1b6d8654bf11
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`Q_A_RATE_FF_ENAB <Q_A_RATE_FF_ENAB>` to 1 after the tests are "
"complete."
msgstr "测试完成后将 :ref:`Q_A_RATE_FF_ENAB <Q_A_RATE_FF_ENAB>` 设置为 1。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:381
#: c61f3876ad524dbbb00223a34453da0d
msgid "Step 12: Autotuning"
msgstr "第 12 步：自动调参"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:382
#: 3f3d01ab6c084bb797df4a21ed2bd306
msgid ""
"Often, the default params or a good manual tune will be sufficient. However,"
" autotuning can usually improve the tune."
msgstr "通常，默认参数或良好的手动调参就足够了。但是，自动调参通常可以改善调参结果。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:384
#: 4f33fb57b7534b03b300b1aecfaa663d
msgid ""
"If the aircraft appears stable enough to attempt autotuning and you have "
"sufficient battery to last through an autotuning session then you can "
"autotune using one of two methods:"
msgstr "如果飞行器看起来足够稳定以尝试自动调参，并且您有足够的电量维持整个自动调参会话，则可以使用以下两种方法之一进行自动调参："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:387
#: 21636e669e76465491bf3134f977f505
msgid ":ref:`QUICKTUNE <quicktune>`"
msgstr ":ref:`QUICKTUNE <quicktune>`"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:388
#: 4dc10481661440bd90edeeab0f4567f5
msgid ""
"QAUTOTUNE Mode (no longer the recommended method, and is not compiled into "
"most firmware)."
msgstr "QAUTOTUNE 模式（不再是推荐方法，大多数固件中未编译）。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:391
#: 1dc92bc714d24113a31c00ba62cf4bdb
msgid "Using the Quick VTOL Tune LUA Applet to Automate Tuning"
msgstr "使用 Quick VTOL Tune LUA 小程序自动化调参"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:392
#: de034146c6994c0284f16f835d9bde5f
msgid ""
"As of ArduPlane 4.6, this is now integrated into the firmware as code, "
"directly."
msgstr "从 ArduPlane 4.6 起，此功能已直接作为代码集成到固件中。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:394
#: bb621a586d264b18961876bfa0a7f2d0
msgid ""
"For systems using an autopilot with sufficient memory to run :ref:`LUA "
"scripts <common-lua-scripts>`, such as F7 and H7 based controllers, this "
"process has been automated via a LUA Applet."
msgstr ""
"对于使用具有足够内存运行 :ref:`LUA 脚本 <common-lua-scripts>` 的飞控（如基于 F7 和 H7 "
"的控制器）的系统，此过程已通过 LUA 小程序自动化。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:396
#: 34ad12bf93164338b1bbece03a57cc47
msgid ""
"Be sure that scripting has been setup and sufficient memory has been "
"allocated, as explained in :ref:`LUA scripts <common-lua-scripts>`."
msgstr "确保脚本已设置并分配了足够的内存，如 :ref:`LUA 脚本 <common-lua-scripts>` 中所述。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:398
#: fc6acf5d060048acb8482e066b7668c4
msgid ""
"See the `Quick VTOL Tune LUA script "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/VTOL-"
"quicktune.md>`__."
msgstr ""
"参见 `Quick VTOL Tune LUA script "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/VTOL-"
"quicktune.md>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:402
#: 7abe2c1d1f634a8a9c19bc3c07b9a50c
msgid "Using the QAUTOTUNE mode to Automate Tuning"
msgstr "使用 QAUTOTUNE 模式自动化调参"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:404
#: 9d5adbeea5c9479b9c6d73c402e7220c
msgid "Follow the instructions in the :ref:`QAUTOTUNE<qautotune-mode>` page."
msgstr "按照 :ref:`QAUTOTUNE<qautotune-mode>` 页面中的说明操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:406
#: ecf8da2b84af4c2788d25076de81d093
msgid ""
"You should use QAUTOTUNE on one axis at a time (setting "
":ref:`Q_AUTOTUNE_AXES <Q_AUTOTUNE_AXES>` for the axis you want to tune). An "
"autotune of a single axis will typically take 5 to 8 minutes, but will take "
"longer if your manual tune is not good enough. If you do not have enough "
"battery for at least 8 minutes of vertical flight then QAUTOTUNE is not "
"recommended."
msgstr ""
"您应一次只对一个轴使用 QAUTOTUNE（通过设置 :ref:`Q_AUTOTUNE_AXES <Q_AUTOTUNE_AXES>` "
"来选择要调参的轴）。单轴的自动调参通常需要 5 到 8 分钟，但如果手动调参结果不够好则会更长。如果没有足够的电量维持至少 8 "
"分钟的垂直飞行，则不建议使用 QAUTOTUNE。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:413
#: dfd5a074c5a140299bd894fe856c4be5
msgid ""
"There a number of problems that can prevent QAUTOTUNE from providing a good "
"tune. Some of the reason QAUTOTUNE can fail are:"
msgstr "有许多问题可能阻止 QAUTOTUNE 提供良好的调参结果。QAUTOTUNE 失败的一些原因："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:415
#: 500bc33330114771b97579c40bfe421a
msgid "High levels of gyro noise."
msgstr "陀螺仪噪声水平过高。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:416
#: 95d1d1883a1644fda5d48816b898decb
msgid "Incorrect value of :ref:`Q_M_THST_EXPO <Q_M_THST_EXPO>`."
msgstr ":ref:`Q_M_THST_EXPO <Q_M_THST_EXPO>` 值不正确。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:417
#: 94d34ccb1c6d41a7999b35a8b3f062c4
msgid "Flexible frame or payload mount."
msgstr "机架或载荷支架柔性过大。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:418
#: e3d4519cba664093ab610ca1859fcfce
msgid "Overly flexible vibration isolation mount."
msgstr "减震安装座过于柔软。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:419
#: 2e02dbb311d641fd8ebe11cf13bd219c
msgid "Non-linear ESC response."
msgstr "ESC 响应非线性。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:420
#: 41c14b074ce44e65834a3859c689256e
msgid "Very low setting for :ref:`Q_M_SPIN_MIN <Q_M_SPIN_MIN>`."
msgstr ":ref:`Q_M_SPIN_MIN <Q_M_SPIN_MIN>` 设置过低。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:421
#: 11c841fc78c043299391215c29f9141e
msgid "Overloaded propellers or motors."
msgstr "螺旋桨或电机过载。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:422
#: 3ca9fa0997244324b656d0e3d867b69e
msgid ""
"Autotuning a Tailsitter's pitch or yaw axis, or vectored yaw axis on "
"TiltRotor, since they require feed-forward."
msgstr "自动调参尾坐式的俯仰或偏航轴，或倾转旋翼的矢量偏航轴，因为这些需要前馈。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:424
#: daf71dc702f74a74ad6658d08025d005
msgid "If QAUTOTUNE has failed you will need to re-do a manual tune."
msgstr "如果 QAUTOTUNE 失败，您将需要重新进行手动调参。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:426
#: 131ea6cc4561439b98c2d874a632e82f
msgid "Some signs that QAUTOTUNE has been successful are:"
msgstr "QAUTOTUNE 成功的一些迹象："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:428
#: db64253589684ea88aac7f98a4d15b42
msgid ""
"An increase in the values of :ref:`Q_A_ANG_PIT_P <Q_A_ANG_PIT_P>` and "
":ref:`Q_A_ANG_RLL_P <Q_A_ANG_RLL_P>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_A_ANG_PIT_P <Q_A_ANG_PIT_P>` 和 :ref:`Q_A_ANG_RLL_P <Q_A_ANG_RLL_P>` "
"值增加。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:429
#: 797af88c10354c9fb532cb3d693fb1ad
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_A_RAT_PIT_D <Q_A_RAT_PIT_D>` and :ref:`Q_A_RAT_RLL_D "
"<Q_A_RAT_RLL_D>` are larger than :ref:`Q_AUTOTUNE_MIN_D <Q_AUTOTUNE_MIN_D>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_A_RAT_PIT_D <Q_A_RAT_PIT_D>` 和 :ref:`Q_A_RAT_RLL_D <Q_A_RAT_RLL_D>` "
"大于 :ref:`Q_AUTOTUNE_MIN_D <Q_AUTOTUNE_MIN_D>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:431
#: 7df738d9fea74f7abdb906f947e4f77d
msgid ""
"QAUTOTUNE will attempt to tune each axis as tight as the aircraft can "
"tolerate. In some aircraft this can be unnecessarily responsive. A guide for"
" most aircraft:"
msgstr "QAUTOTUNE 将尝试将每个轴调参到飞行器能承受的最紧状态。在某些飞行器上，这可能会导致不必要的灵敏响应。大多数飞行器的参考值："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:433
#: 5a133a2dc1164969a26d0594eb377fa2
msgid ":ref:`Q_A_ANG_PIT_P <Q_A_ANG_PIT_P>` should be reduced from 10 to 6"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_A_ANG_PIT_P <Q_A_ANG_PIT_P>` 应从 10 降低到 6"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:434
#: 1c2eb0edd3954b65a299395ff5ea7f46
msgid ":ref:`Q_A_ANG_RLL_P <Q_A_ANG_RLL_P>` should be reduced from 10 to 6"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_A_ANG_RLL_P <Q_A_ANG_RLL_P>` 应从 10 降低到 6"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:435
#: 917b149290ba4853931a0b8a90a38bf4
msgid ":ref:`Q_A_ANG_YAW_P <Q_A_ANG_YAW_P>` should be reduced from 10 to 6"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_A_ANG_YAW_P <Q_A_ANG_YAW_P>` 应从 10 降低到 6"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:436
#: 0b6e4934706c45a48c1aea7522875d98
msgid ":ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_P <Q_A_RAT_YAW_P>` should be reduced from 1 to 0.5"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_P <Q_A_RAT_YAW_P>` 应从 1 降低到 0.5"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:437
#: 5e0c381fc6864e959dcc6d0cd9f60e00
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_I <Q_A_RAT_YAW_I>`: :ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_P <Q_A_RAT_YAW_P>` x"
" 0.1"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_I <Q_A_RAT_YAW_I>`：:ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_P <Q_A_RAT_YAW_P>` × "
"0.1"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:439
#: 55af21d847ec447ab04657c562ab2a65
msgid ""
"These values should only be changed if QAUTOTUNE produces higher values. "
"Small aerobatic aircraft may prefer to keep these values as high as "
"possible."
msgstr "这些值仅在 QAUTOTUNE 产生更高值时才应更改。小型特技飞行器可能倾向于保持这些值尽可能高。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:442
#: 2c82f3032032483881754f42d5c14293
msgid "Step 13: Setting the input shaping parameters"
msgstr "第 13 步：设置输入整形参数"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:444
#: 789a835f1cab41b4a78bb5ef9d781d99
msgid ""
"QuadPlane has a set of parameters that define the way the aircraft feels to "
"fly. This allows the aircraft to be set up with a very aggressive tune but "
"still feel like a very docile and friendly aircraft to fly."
msgstr "四旋翼飞机有一组参数定义飞行器的飞行手感。这允许飞行器以非常激进的调参结果设置，但仍然感觉像一架非常温和、友好的飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:446
#: f14b31dcf87743029c03cbfa477028e6
msgid "The most important of these parameters is:"
msgstr "这些参数中最重要的是："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:448
#: b44deb12099d4d7e821d794ab9290147
msgid ":ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_P <Q_A_RAT_YAW_P>`: yaw rate x 45 degrees/s"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_P <Q_A_RAT_YAW_P>`：偏航速率 × 45 度/秒"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:449
#: 984912dd98e44d4b8a0a43f7c457aca4
msgid ":ref:`Q_A_ANGLE_MAX <Q_A_ANGLE_MAX>`:  maximum lean angle"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_A_ANGLE_MAX <Q_A_ANGLE_MAX>`：最大倾斜角"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:450
#: 0069c146d1464b91a9b71141c7538cab
msgid ":ref:`Q_A_ACC_P_MAX <Q_A_ACC_P_MAX>`: Pitch rate acceleration"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_A_ACC_P_MAX <Q_A_ACC_P_MAX>`：俯仰速率加速度"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:451
#: 0cfedd8da0ac46f69e1da8bf6a461d5b
msgid ":ref:`Q_A_ACC_R_MAX <Q_A_ACC_R_MAX>`: Roll rate acceleration"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_A_ACC_R_MAX <Q_A_ACC_R_MAX>`：横滚速率加速度"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:452
#: 5741cd51f52d40e78027782bfaa624af
msgid ":ref:`Q_A_ACC_Y_MAX <Q_A_ACC_Y_MAX>`: Yaw rate acceleration"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_A_ACC_Y_MAX <Q_A_ACC_Y_MAX>`：偏航速率加速度"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:453
#: ac53fd42f39a46849361cda2584a66de
msgid ":ref:`Q_A_ANG_LIM_TC <Q_A_ANG_LIM_TC>`: Aircraft smoothing time"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_A_ANG_LIM_TC <Q_A_ANG_LIM_TC>`：飞行器平滑时间"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:455
#: 31151e3829004ce1944d73a8d075e64e
msgid ""
"QAUTOTUNE mode tuning will set the :ref:`Q_A_ACC_P_MAX<Q_A_ACC_P_MAX>`, "
":ref:`Q_A_ACC_R_MAX<Q_A_ACC_R_MAX>` and :ref:`Q_A_ACC_Y_MAX<Q_A_ACC_Y_MAX>` "
"parameters to their maximum based on measurements done during the QAUTOTUNE "
"tests. These values should not be increased beyond what QAUTOTUNE suggests "
"without careful testing. In most cases pilots will want to reduce these "
"values significantly."
msgstr ""
"QAUTOTUNE 模式调参会根据 QAUTOTUNE 测试期间的测量结果，将 "
":ref:`Q_A_ACC_P_MAX<Q_A_ACC_P_MAX>`、:ref:`Q_A_ACC_R_MAX<Q_A_ACC_R_MAX>` 和 "
":ref:`Q_A_ACC_Y_MAX<Q_A_ACC_Y_MAX>` 参数设置为其最大值。未经仔细测试，不应将这些值增大到超出 QAUTOTUNE "
"的建议值。大多数情况下，飞手会希望显著降低这些值。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:457
#: 14935cb3820e40f885ff836565695e56
msgid ""
"The Quick VTOL Tune LUA Applet will not adjust these from defaults and you "
"may adjust them to get the feel you desire."
msgstr "Quick VTOL Tune LUA 小程序不会从默认值调整这些参数，您可以根据所需手感进行调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:459
#: fb4354f80a6745d19988129359abd050
msgid ""
"For aircraft designed to carry large directly mounted payloads, the maximum "
"values of :ref:`Q_A_ACC_P_MAX<Q_A_ACC_P_MAX>`, "
":ref:`Q_A_ACC_R_MAX<Q_A_ACC_R_MAX>` and :ref:`Q_A_ACC_Y_MAX<Q_A_ACC_Y_MAX>` "
"should be reduced based on the minimum and maximum takeoff weight (TOW):"
msgstr ""
"对于设计用于直接挂载大型载荷的飞行器，应根据最小和最大起飞重量（TOW）降低 "
":ref:`Q_A_ACC_P_MAX<Q_A_ACC_P_MAX>`、:ref:`Q_A_ACC_R_MAX<Q_A_ACC_R_MAX>` 和 "
":ref:`Q_A_ACC_Y_MAX<Q_A_ACC_Y_MAX>` 的最大值："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:461
#: 5ded127819cc48f0877604a998bd62fa
msgid ":ref:`Q_A_ACC_P_MAX<Q_A_ACC_P_MAX>`  x (min_TOW / max_TOW)"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_A_ACC_P_MAX<Q_A_ACC_P_MAX>` x (min_TOW / max_TOW)"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:462
#: 4be201330dfd4f6c8290d8005a3aeb06
msgid ":ref:`Q_A_ACC_R_MAX<Q_A_ACC_R_MAX>`  x (min_TOW / max_TOW)"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_A_ACC_R_MAX<Q_A_ACC_R_MAX>` x (min_TOW / max_TOW)"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:463
#: 3228eabf3c89425382aeefbd843c1766
msgid ":ref:`Q_A_ACC_Y_MAX<Q_A_ACC_Y_MAX>`  x (min_TOW / max_TOW)"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_A_ACC_Y_MAX<Q_A_ACC_Y_MAX>` x (min_TOW / max_TOW)"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:465
#: cd2b774a80204088bcbc7127270df9af
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_P <Q_A_RAT_YAW_P>` should be set to be approximately 0.5 x"
" :ref:`Q_A_ACC_Y_MAX<Q_A_ACC_Y_MAX>` / 4500 to ensure that the aircraft can "
"achieve full yaw rate in approximately half a second."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_P <Q_A_RAT_YAW_P>` 应设置为约 0.5 x "
":ref:`Q_A_ACC_Y_MAX<Q_A_ACC_Y_MAX>` / 4500，以确保飞行器能在约半秒内达到最大偏航速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:467
#: 7aa767f700554323b90049e15da38a4b
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_A_ANG_LIM_TC <Q_A_ANG_LIM_TC>` may be increased to provide a very "
"smooth feeling on the sticks at the expense of a slower reaction time."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_A_ANG_LIM_TC <Q_A_ANG_LIM_TC>` 可以增加，以牺牲较慢的响应时间为代价，在摇杆上提供非常平滑的手感。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:469
#: 4265b5fbd29b4df6933f2dcdd714de3f
msgid ""
"Aerobatic aircraft should keep the :ref:`Q_A_ACC_P_MAX<Q_A_ACC_P_MAX>`, "
":ref:`Q_A_ACC_R_MAX<Q_A_ACC_R_MAX>` and :ref:`Q_A_ACC_Y_MAX<Q_A_ACC_Y_MAX>` "
"provided by QAUTOTUNE and reduce :ref:`Q_A_ANG_LIM_TC <Q_A_ANG_LIM_TC>` to "
"achieve the stick feel desired by the pilot."
msgstr ""
"特技飞行器应保留 QAUTOTUNE 给出的 "
":ref:`Q_A_ACC_P_MAX<Q_A_ACC_P_MAX>`、:ref:`Q_A_ACC_R_MAX<Q_A_ACC_R_MAX>` 和 "
":ref:`Q_A_ACC_Y_MAX<Q_A_ACC_Y_MAX>`，并降低 :ref:`Q_A_ANG_LIM_TC "
"<Q_A_ANG_LIM_TC>` 以获得飞手所需的摇杆手感。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning-process.rst:471
#: a3cfcf95b07f4615aeb63b7a57a9d44f
